Subject: Cantor Identity Accounting Journal and Host Protocol P1 Formation Solution

& [FormedSolution]
  + retain a complete replayable journal of ledger snapshots and the exact patches connecting them
  + expose one strict protocol whose read operations are inert and whose patch operation returns one explicit successor
  + serialize the complete journal to canonical bounded bytes that an external host may durably store

& [ImplementationBoundary]
  + no physical adapter is needed to prove P1; byte custody and invocation are explicit caller boundaries
